<title>USA: Quiksilver sets 500,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>Quiksilver sets 500,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quiksilver Inc said Thursday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of Quicksilver common over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>Repurchases will be funded from existing cash, internally generated funds or through short-term debt, it said.</p>
<p>Shares repurchased initially will be held as treasury shares and may be used in connection with the company's stock option program and for other general corporate purposes, including acquisitions, it said.</p>
</text>
